ew databases\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.95,\"noveltyJustification\":\"File upload flow, comment gap, multi-view reconstruction workflow are all new\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-4\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-4\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:20:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":5,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Notion API 2.0 data-source model impact on inventory strategy\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Rate-limit budget analysis, data-source bridge flow, truncation mitigation\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-7\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-7\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:25:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Nested page hierarchy preservation and reconstruction\",\"findingsCount\":4,\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Hierarchy gap analysis extends prior-findings single 'preserved' claim\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-8\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-8\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:30:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":7,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Required vs optional Obsidian plugins with install/config notes\",\"findingsCount\":4,\"newInfoRatio\":0.75,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Complete plugin matrix with install methods, priority ranking, agent-configurability\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-5\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-5\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:35:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":8,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Parity verification and acceptance checklist automation\",\"findingsCount\":4,\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Full automated parity script, two-pass verification strategy, manual-gap analysis\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-6\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-6\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:40:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":9,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"AI agent programmatic migration vs human-in-the-loop\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Hybrid flow design with exact human-vs-AI step mapping and autonomy outlook\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-9\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-9\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:45:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"run\":10,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Rate limits, batching, large-workspace scalability, remaining gaps\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.7,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Rate-limit budget for defined workspace scale, batching strategies, decisive method summary\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ-10\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ-10\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T00:50:00Z\",\"durationMs\":120000}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":10,\"answeredCount\":10,\"totalQuestions\":10,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-21T01:00:00Z\"}","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-state.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-state.jsonl","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-state.jsonl","time":{"start":1787344776930,"end":1787344776941}},"id":"prt_0260ca94a001jwCz6FvY9YbLpe","sessionID":"ses_fd9fbd8f6ffe5QlvbFKBCh0T14","messageID":"msg_0260c8efa001v0UTuyBNzao730"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787344803436,"sessionID":"ses_fd9fbd8f6ffe5QlvbFKBCh0T14","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_64f79fac722a4652b275554f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"openQuestions\": [],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-1\",\"text\":\"Importer choice: API vs HTML .zip — concrete losses per path\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-001.md §F1.1 + iteration-005.md §F5.2 + prior-findings.md §1\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-2\",\"text\":\"Relations/rollups/formulas recovery method\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.1-F3.5 — Notion Bases plugin handles >90%, Dataview supplements\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-3\",\"text\":\"mcp-notion-reads / mcp-obsidian-writes division of labor\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-001.md §F1.1-F1.4 + iteration-002.md §F2.1-F2.4\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-4\",\"text\":\"Files/attachments/comments/multi-view databases carry-over\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-004.md §F4.1-F4.5\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-5\",\"text\":\"Required vs optional Obsidian plugins\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-007.md §F7.1-F7.4 — Notion Bases P0, Dataview P1, Tasks conditional\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-6\",\"text\":\"Parity verification — no silent data loss checks\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-008.md §F8.1-F8.4 — two-pass AI + human verification\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-7\",\"text\":\"Notion API 2.0 data-source model impact on inventory\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-005.md §F5.1-F5.5 — database→data-source bridge required\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-8\",\"text\":\"Nested page hierarchy handling during import\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-006.md §F6.1-F6.4 — preserved but ordering and breadcrumbs lost\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-9\",\"text\":\"AI agent programmatic migration vs human-in-the-loop\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-009.md §F9.1-F9.5 — hybrid model; 3 GUI steps human, all else AI\"},\n    {\"id\":\"KQ-10\",\"text\":\"Rate limits and batching for large workspaces\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-010.md §F10.1-F10.5 — ~64 min for 5000 pages at 3 req/s\"}\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    {\"id\":\"F-001\",\"text\":\"API importer preserves databases → Bases; HTML loses all DB structure\",\"source\":\"prior-findings.md §1 + iteration-001.md\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\",\"001\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-002\",\"text\":\"Bases has no native relations/rollups — Notion Bases plugin or Dataview needed\",\"source\":\"prior-findings.md §2-3 + iteration-003.md\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\",\"003\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-003\",\"text\":\"mcp-notion exposes 24 tools across 6 domains; 5 API gaps require direct API calls\",\"source\":\"mcp-notion SKILL.md + iteration-001.md\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\",\"001\",\"005\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-004\",\"text\":\"mcp-obsidian operates at file layer via notesmd-cli (headless) + MCP (live app, 14 tools)\",\"source\":\"mcp-obsidian SKILL.md + iteration-002.md\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\",\"002\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-005\",\"text\":\"In-app Importer cannot be AI-driven; agent works around it via file-layer operations\",\"source\":\"prior-findings.md §5 + iteration-009.md\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\",\"009\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-006\",\"text\":\"Notion Bases plugin (bgarciamoura/obsidian-notion-bases-plugin) is P0 required for relations/rollups/formulas/extra views\",\"source\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.1-F3.5 + iteration-007.md §F7.1\",\"iterations\":[\"003\",\"007\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-007\",\"text\":\"Three-way plugin recovery matrix: Notion Bases > Dataview > .base files for every relation/rollup/formula pattern\",\"source\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.1\",\"iterations\":[\"003\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-008\",\"text\":\"Comment migration is not supported by the importer; reconstruction via callout blocks is the AI agent's task\",\"source\":\"iteration-004.md §F4.3\",\"iterations\":[\"004\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-009\",\"text\":\"API 2.0 data-source model requires database→data_source_id bridging during inventory\",\"source\":\"iteration-005.md §F5.2\",\"iterations\":[\"005\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-010\",\"text\":\"Notion page hierarchy is preserved by the API importer as folder nesting; ordering and breadcrumbs are lost\",\"source\":\"iteration-006.md §F6.1-F6.2\",\"iterations\":[\"006\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-011\",\"text\":\"Hybrid migration flow: human does 3 GUI actions (create integration, install plugins, run Import), AI does everything else\",\"source\":\"iteration-009.md §F9.3-F9.4\",\"iterations\":[\"009\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-012\",\"text\":\"Large workspace (5000 pages, 50 DBs) requires ~64 min API time at 3 req/s for full deep inventory\",\"source\":\"iteration-010.md §F10.1\",\"iterations\":[\"010\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-013\",\"text\":\"Two-pass verification: AI automated script (page count, link validation, attachment presence, row count, frontmatter check) + human sample (5% page quality, 10 critical formulas)\",\"source\":\"iteration-008.md §F8.4\",\"iterations\":[\"008\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-014\",\"text\":\"Relation reconstruction is the highest-value AI task — rewriting UUIDs to [[wikilinks]] across hundreds of notes saves hours vs manual\",\"source\":\"iteration-009.md §F9.4 + prior-findings.md §5\",\"iterations\":[\"009\"]},\n    {\"id\":\"F-015\",\"text\":\"Notion-specific formula functions (prop(), name(), style(), unstyle()) have no direct Obsidian equivalent and require manual translation\",\"source\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.3\",\"iterations\":[\"003\"]}\n  ],\n  \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n    {\"approach\":\"HTML .zip export for database-heavy workspaces\",\"reason\":\"Loses all database views, properties, formulas, relations, rollups\",\"evidence\":\"prior-findings.md §1\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\"]},\n    {\"approach\":\"Notion Markdown export\",\"reason\":\"Omits important data per official Obsidian docs\",\"evidence\":\"prior-findings.md §1\",\"iterations\":[\"seed\"]},\n    {\"approach\":\".base-only approach for relational workspaces\",\"reason\":\".base files (core Bases) support only 6 column types — no relations, rollups, formulas\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.4\",\"iterations\":[\"003\"]},\n    {\"approach\":\"Pure Dataview for multi-view databases\",\"reason\":\"Dataview has TABLE/LIST/CALENDAR but no Board/Gantt/Chart/Gallery views\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-003.md §F3.2\",\"iterations\":[\"003\"]},\n    {\"approach\":\"Full autonomous AI migration without human GUI actions\",\"reason\":\"Importer and plugin installation are GUI-only in 2026; no CLI API exists\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-009.md §F9.5\",\"iterations\":[\"009\"]},\n    {\"approach\":\"Expecting 100% automated verification\",\"reason\":\"Formula parity and visual layout require human sample-check\",\"evidence\":\"iteration-008.md §F8.3\",\"iterations\":[\"008\"]}\n  ]\n}","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/findings-registry.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/findings-registry.json","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/mcp-tooling/015-notion-to-obisidian-migration/001-deep-research/research/lineages/deepseek/findings-registry.json","time":{"start":1787344803423,"end":1787344803434}},"id":"prt_0260cef45001vwOsGtOq60umTI","sessionID":"ses_fd9fbd8f6ffe5QlvbFKBCh0T14","messageID":"msg_0260c8efa001v0UTuyBNzao730"}}
